'''Smoke clouds''' is a detrimental [[ground effect]] that inflicts [[blind]]. The effect shared the same status icon name and graphic with {{stl|Blind}}ed, but with different text description.

[[File:Smoke Cloud.png|thumb|Smoke cloud]]
__NOTOC__
==Sources==
* {{il|Smoke Mine}}
** [[Wiraqucha, Ancient Guardian]], a vaal side area boss, use monster-version of Smoke Mine skill (id: [[Skill:MonsterSmokeMineSideArea|MonsterSmokeMineSideArea]] and [[Skill:MonsterSmokeMineSnakeSideArea|MonsterSmokeMineSnakeSideArea]])
* [[Shrine|Shrouded Shrines]]
* Enemies with the "Ambushes" [[monster modifier]]
* {{sl|Fog of War}} skill from {{il|Kongming's Stratagem}}.
===Base items===
{{Drop enabled base item table
|tables=items
|where= items.stat_text LIKE "%smoke%"
|level=1
|large=1
|stat=1
}}

===Unique items===
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=
  item_stats.id LIKE "%smoke%"
|level=1
|large=1
|stat=1
}}
===Base passives===
{{Query base passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Smoke%Cloud%"
}}

===Ascendancy passives===
{{Query ascendancy passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Smoke%Cloud%"
}}

===Cluster jewel passive skills===
The following [[cluster jewel]]-only passives are related to Smoke cloud:
{{Passive skill table
|q_where=
  passive_skills.id LIKE "affliction%"
  AND passive_skills.stat_text LIKE "%Smoke%Cloud%"
|large=1
|stat_text=1
}}

